WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.557
Open the agent and select Chat settings

00:00:04.557 --> 00:00:07.141
Turn on Show past chats in the widget

00:00:07.141 --> 00:00:10.934
Choose how long chats are kept and how much the agent re-reads

00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:13.562
On your site, a visitor opens the widget

00:00:13.562 --> 00:00:17.510
Click the History button to see past chats

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:21.784
Click a chat to reopen it, widgets included

00:00:21.784 --> 00:00:24.587
Typing a message carries on the same chat
